# Local dev needs no values here at all — leave both unset and the app
# writes to a plain SQLite file at server/data/instagrom.db.
#
# For production (Vercel), create a free database at https://turso.tech,
# then set these two as Environment Variables in your Vercel project
# settings (Project Settings → Environment Variables):
#
# DATABASE_URL=libsql://your-database-name.turso.io
# DATABASE_AUTH_TOKEN=the-token-turso-gives-you
